[h2]Disable Tactical View[/h2]
Blocks Arma's Tactical View action while the addon is active. Use your scenario or difficulty settings to control ordinary third-person view.

[h2]How to enable it[/h2]
In Eden, place the [b]Disable Tactical View[/b] module to use it in that scenario. A trigger can turn the module on and off. Enable it without an Eden module through [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=450814997]CBA_A3[/url]. Open [b]Addon Options → Disable Tactical View[/b], check [b]Enable Disable Tactical View[/b] and restart the mission. In multiplayer, use the Server tab.

